{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1552497-night-horrors-primordial-peerage-on-the-stv","id":1552497,"title":"Night Horrors: Primordial Peerage on the STV","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-07-17T10:16:43-07:00","id":1552497,"title":"Night Horrors: Primordial Peerage on the STV","content":"Some of us have been cooking behind the scenes and the product is finally here! Primordial Peerage collects and refines a lot of what the community has written about Beast, much of it from these forums, to provide you with plenty of wicked and weird antagonists for any CofD game<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/m/product/529779?affiliate_id=498510&lt;br%20/&gt;%20zz0.06dch1vkbo8gzz\" target=\"_blank\">Check it out here!</a><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Night Horrors: Primordial Peerage seeks to expand on the material in Beast: The Primordial with additional templates uniquely related to the Begotten\u2019s spheres of influence, particularly the Primordial Dream, with detailed instructions on how to build and run them. They can serve as allies, enemies, or compelling mysteries in more Beast-centric chronicles, or provide new options for the players themselves.<br /> <br /> This book includes:<ul><li>Twelve different templates and creature types to spice up your chronicles.</li> <li>One new Inheritance, the Emancipated, who tether to the Bright Dream (and scorn their Mother)</li> <li>Details on how each template interacts with the Begotten, including new Kinship abilities.</li> <li>Story hooks on how each creature interacts with the other denizens of the Primordial Dream.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>",